<li>Yu~ki (bass)</li>
<li>Kami (drums)</li>
</ul>
Malice Mizer pada era Bara no Seidou 1999-2001:
<ul>
<li>Mana (gitar, synthesizer)</li>
<li>Közi (gitar)</li>
<li>Klaha(vokal)</li>
